      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EAT YOUR SPINACH (1) doesn't have the best strike-rate but recent form is sound. Has hit the frame the last two runs, the latest when third (23.69) at this track. Solid record here winning two races. Deserves serious consideration. MEXICAN JACK (4) had been in great form but was out of the placings last run, finishing fourth (23.86) in a Grade 5 at this track. Generally fast into stride but was shuffled back from the tricky draw last time. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Worth following up. MYRNIONG STORM (2) has been out of the placings at his last couple but on the winners' heels when placing three back (21.99) in a Grade 4/5 at Warrnambool. Has the ability and expected to do much better. ODDLY COOL (7) has been a model of consistency and deserves plenty of thought.",
